@crew taavek
// Writer (command: guests), batch 3b. Taavek: few common words; points, sketches, laughs at the gaps.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hello! Taavek. Engineer. Yes. The round one, there. Mine. From the crate.
- Good day! Coffee? I have sweets. We trade. Good trade.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- {me}! Good. You know the word for this? No? Then it is "the round one".   #funny
== feel
? mood:high
- Good day! Your machine and my machine, they talk now. Good.
? mood:low
- Hard day. Too many words. Not enough words. Both.
== near
? deck:5
- Your bay. I draw everything. The wall of tools, I draw twice. Beautiful.
? act:meal
- Your coffee. Very bitter. Very good. I take three.   #funny
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I sketch every machine. When I go home, I show them your ship. On paper.   #warm
